rge part of the cards number.","goals":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-4,"call":"Around 3.0 goals","text":"The numbers say 3.1 goals. Fortuna are without forwards Romeny and Zeefuik and midfielder Michut, none of whom the numbers take off, and have scored only 8 in their last six (partly counted). Guth starting on the bench weakens their defence, which pulls the other way, so I trim to about 3.0."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 10.5 corners","text":"The numbers say 10.5 corners, already cut a little for Fortuna's low recent count (20 in six). Go Ahead should press and push down the wings as usual at De Adelaarshorst, and Fortuna's absences are already showing in that low count, so I stay at 10.5."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 3.7 cards","text":"The numbers say 3.7 cards: Martijn Vos's very high card rate (+40%) pushes it up, while Go Ahead's 4 cards in their last six (the league's cleanest side) and Fortuna's low count pull it down, all already counted. Go Ahead want to be harder in duels and to shadow Ihattaren, which could bring a few fouls, but no bans or flashpoints are reported, so I stay at 3.7."},"shots":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-4,"call":"Around 26.5 shots","text":"The numbers say 27.6 shots. Fortuna's shooting is down recently (64 in six, counted) and they are still missing several first-choice attackers the numbers don't list, with Descotte and Peterson expected up front, so I lean lower to about 26.5."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-4,"call":"Around 9.3 shots on target","text":"The numbers say 9.7 shots on target. With Romeny, Zeefuik and Michut out and Ihattaren left to carry the attack, Fortuna should test Cillessen less than the numbers assume; about 9.3."},"sources":["https://fortuna-online.nl/voorbeschouwing-go-ahead-uit-2/","https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/go-ahead-eagles/preview/go-ahead-eagles-vs-sittard-prediction-team-news-lineups_609534.html","https://www.deventervoetba